FILE     kc8102.nc (from line 1)
FILE     ../../fanuc_macros/programs/p247_O8102.nc (from line 11)
DIALECT  series 0 (given)
NOTE     -fparam default: the factory settings are assumed
NOTE     the output assigns variables: the DX32 needs the PPPL option (param 285 bit 4)
NOTE     drilling cycles are written out as moves; cycle values in D20 D22 D23 D24 D25
NOTE     G43/G49 left out: the DX32 applies the tool length of the tool in the spindle from its table (TENTATIVE)
NOTE     -ftool 1: T1 must be in the spindle when the program starts
NOTE     1 called program(s) written as DX32 macros #1-#1, nested 1 deep
NOTE     the output needs BOSS 4-7 compatibility mode off
WROTE    dxtk.txt
CHECK    dxsim reads dxtk.txt cleanly and reaches all 18 FANUC end points in order
RESULT   ok
